edge across the 20 mm stock, no `start`, `both_pieces_restrained` and `stock_centered_in_xy_travel` true, `clearance` at most 3.6, option `separationLengthMm: 0`), and 0.25 mm wire; see `docs/user-guide/agie-wire-edm.md`); milling posts refuse wire cuts by name. Neither built-in wire `.mch` ships with `edm.conditions`, and the wire posts are not exercised on a physical EDM control.
