From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:43:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] docs(decisions): port the #2961 punch group onto the
 zero-step writer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
